@startuml
title cnn_v11 自对弈样本缓冲区 — 主流程

actor 用户
participant "CLI 脚本\nmcts_sample_buffer.py" as CLI
participant "CppMctsSampleBufferAdapter\n(Python)" as Adapter
participant "SampleBufferManager\n(Python)" as Buffer
participant "GameRunner\n(C++)" as Runner
participant "Game线程×N\n(C++)" as GameThread
participant "SampleAugmentor\n(C++)" as Augmentor
participant "MctsThreadPool\n(全局单例)" as Pool
participant "NeuralNet\n(全局共享GPU)" as NN

用户 -> CLI: --model cnn_v11.1 --games 1000
CLI -> CLI: 解析参数
CLI -> CLI: 通过 registry 查找 TorchScript 路径

CLI -> Adapter: 创建适配器(model_spec, games, config)
Adapter -> Adapter: 解析 TorchScript 路径
Adapter -> Buffer: 创建 SampleBufferManager("sample_buffer/", max=80000)
Adapter -> Runner: 创建 C++ GameRunner(model, games, config, collect_samples=true)
Runner -> Pool: 初始化全局线程池(若未初始化)
Runner -> NN: 初始化全局 GPU 推理引擎(若未初始化)

Runner -> GameThread: 启动 N 个游戏线程

loop 每局并行
    GameThread -> GameThread: 初始化棋盘，确定执方(交替模式)

    loop 每步
        GameThread -> GameThread: 记录 state(落子前)
        note right of GameThread: state = board + current_player (226维)
        GameThread -> Pool: MCTS 搜索 → submit 模拟任务
        Pool -> NN: 攒批 GPU 推理
        NN --> Pool: 返回策略+价值
        Pool --> GameThread: visit_counts
        GameThread -> GameThread: 保存 (state, visit_counts, current_player)
        GameThread -> GameThread: 温度采样选动作 → 落子 → 终局判定
    end

    GameThread -> GameThread: 对局结束，若 winner != 0:
    GameThread -> GameThread: 遍历每步：计算 z(±1)，归一化 pi
    GameThread -> Augmentor: augment(raw_sample) × 每步
    Augmentor --> GameThread: 8 条增强变体
    GameThread -> Runner: 上报 GameResult(含 samples)
end

loop 进度轮询 (Python 主线程)
    CLI -> Adapter: poll progress
    Adapter -> Runner: get_completed_count()
    Runner --> Adapter: completed / total

    alt 新完成 >= chunk_games(10) 局
        Adapter -> Runner: get_results()
        Runner --> Adapter: List[GameResult]
        Adapter -> Adapter: 提取新增对局的 samples
        Adapter -> Buffer: ingest(game_start, game_end, samples)

        alt buffer 总样本 >= 80000
            Buffer -> Buffer: 淘汰最旧 chunk(删除文件+更新 manifest)
        end

        Buffer --> Adapter: evicted_count
        Adapter --> CLI: 进度 + 缓冲区状态
    end
end

Runner --> Adapter: 所有局完成
Adapter -> Buffer: 最后一批样本落盘

CLI -> CLI: 打印最终统计
CLI -> CLI: 打印 GPU 监控统计

@enduml
